<title>AUSTRALIA: Wesfarmers looks for year profit rise.</title>
<headline>Wesfarmers looks for year profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agricultural, energy and hardware group Wesfarmers Ltd said on Monday it expects a reasonable increase in profit in the year to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The outlook for the full year remains pretty positive. We believe some of the positive variances we've had in the first six months will be maintained and we're looking for a pretty reasonable increase on last year's profit,&quot; managing director Michael Chaney told reporters.</p>
</text>
